{
  "id": "poem-068",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">在这个世界的一隅，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">意识去了知晓的角落。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">然而真相只在我内心，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">丑陋与美丽共融。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">善良天使徜徉心间，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">所在即是净土。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">反之亦有魔鬼身影，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">取决于我每个当下。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我选择什么，即是我，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我的感知决定我的境界。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">在这片浪漫的世界里，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我和自己约定盟约。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/068.webp\" data-caption=\"《同行》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《同行》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/068.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《同行》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《同行》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 68 页</p>"
}
